proposals.rule:
A pre-emptive hold at the tower. Conditions:
- the first-wave window is on (an enemy knight barracks stands or enemy knights are out, and s.turn < WAVE_UNTIL);
- an enemy knight is within WAVE_STAY of the queen and none is within THREAT_RANGE, so the defence and kite rules have not taken over;
- she touches an own tower whose HP already reaches TOWER_HP (otherwise the touch rule tops it up as in v11);
- the ladder's next target is a TOWER whose site lies farther from the own back edge than the touched tower.
Then she does not start that walk: she keeps BUILDing the touched tower (top-ups to 800, then a no-op BUILD that holds her there), so the knights meet her under it. Targets behind the tower, mines and barracks are walked to as in v11. The hold ends when the knights come within THREAT_RANGE (defence and kite take over), die, or leave R, or when the window closes. It works alone (v11's targets) and on top of WAVE_BACK.

